@startuml
title Challenges Page — Поиск, фильтры и пагинация

actor User
participant "ChallengesPage" as Page
participant "ChallengeController" as CC
participant "Challenge" as Challenge

User -> Page: input[поиск] → setSearch
Page -> CC: dispatch(getAllChallenges(page=1, pageSize, search, topicId, difficulty, sort))
CC -> Challenge: findAll(page, pageSize, search, topicId, difficulty, sort)
Challenge --> CC: items[], total
CC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: обновлённый список задач

User -> Page: select[тема] / select[сложность] / select[сортировка] → click "Применить"
Page -> CC: dispatch(getAllChallenges(page=1, pageSize, search, topicId, difficulty, sort))
CC -> Challenge: findAll(page, pageSize, search, topicId, difficulty, sort)
Challenge --> CC: items[], total
CC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: отфильтрованный список задач

User -> Page: click пагинация → setPage(n)
Page -> CC: dispatch(getAllChallenges(page=n, pageSize, search, topicId, difficulty, sort))
CC -> Challenge: findAll(page, pageSize, search, topicId, difficulty, sort)
Challenge --> CC: items[], total
CC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: страница n списка задач

User -> Page: click "Сбросить"
Page -> CC: dispatch(getAllChallenges(page=1, pageSize, sort=newest))
CC -> Challenge: findAll(page=1, pageSize, sort=newest)
Challenge --> CC: items[], total
CC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: сброшенный список задач

User -> Page: input[type=range] сложность RandomChallenge → setDifficulty
User -> Page: click "Перейти к задаче" в RandomChallenge
Page --> User: переход на /challenges/:id

User -> Page: click на карточке задачи
Page --> User: переход на /challenges/:id

@enduml
